604	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
605	            <p>
606	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
607	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
608	            </p>
609	            <ul class="feature-list">
610	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
611	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
612	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
613	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
614	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
615	            </ul>
